      <li><a href="/deploy-ai-apps/">Deploy AI Apps</a> for the Lovable, Bolt, and v0 handoff into production.</li>
      <li><a href="/edge/">Edge</a> for Cloudflare, Vercel, Netlify, and runtime tradeoffs.</li>
    </ul>
